  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b><strong>Air Force AFCAT 2/2024 Online Form :</strong></b> As per the recent updates from the various media sources, Indian Air Force (IAF) has released the official notification for the recruitment of AFCAT 02/2024/ NCC Special Entry on its official website. Any candidate who is interested to fill this form, they should check eligibility, age limit &amp; must read the Full Notification Before applying for the Air Force AFCAT 2/2024 Recruitment. Those Candidates Are Interested in the following recruitment can apply online from the link given below. </span></div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; height: auto !important; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 101.884%;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Indian Air Force (IAF)</span></strong></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Air Force AFCAT 2/2024 Merit List</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"width: 101.884%;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Application Start : <strong>30 May 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>28 June 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Last Date Fee Payment : <strong>28 June 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Correction Last Date :<strong> 05-08 July 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Exam Date : <b>September 2024</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Course Commence : <strong>July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Result : <strong>30 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"><strong>Merit List Available Date : 29 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"width: 101.884%;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee (Tentative)</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">All Candidates : <strong>Rs. 550/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">NCC Special Entry : <strong>No Fee</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"width: 101.884%;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Age Limit</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>As on 1 July 2025 :</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Flying Branch and NCC Special Entry :<strong> 20 – 24 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Ground Duty (Tech/Non-Tech) : <strong>20 – 24 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"width: 101.884%;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>AFCAT 2 Recruitment 2024 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Post : 304 Posts</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 19.5205%;\